OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh government and Labour strike
OL,4,Abudget deal with #60m for additional
OL,5,Alearning needs
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Welsh government has reached a deal
OL,8,Fwith Labour on its mini-budget, which
OL,9,Fhad failed to pass in the summer.
OL,11,FMinisters said the Plaid Cymru-led
OL,12,Fadministration had now agreed an extra
OL,13,F#60m for the education of children with
OL,14,Fadditional learning needs (ALN).
OL,16,FLabour, which sits in opposition after
OL,17,Flosing May's Senedd election, had
OL,18,Frejected a #40m a year deal across
OL,19,Fthree years, in angry scenes at the
OL,20,FWelsh Parliament in the last week of
OL,21,Fterm in July.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
